  "description": "Erection of a new rear dormer extension; removal of the chimney, and replacement of the existing roof; the demolition of the existing rear extension and WC and construction of a new rear ground floor extension; the installation of new triple glazing, rooflights and solar photovoltaic roof panels; rendering of the rear wall; replacement of the existing front door and porch and the installation of an Air Source Heat Pump in rear garden.",
